  "properties": {
    "title": "GeoServer 3 tour",
    "description": "GeoServer 3 is a significant update for this beloved OSGeo Application.  This presentation provides practical tour of GeoServer 3 covering upgrade steps, new requirements, and refreshed UI!\n\nIt has been seventeen years since the initial release of GeoSever 2, so what can you expect when you run GeoServer 3 for the first time?\r\n\r\nThis tour covers:\r\n\r\n- Upgrade steps, new requirements, and getting started!\r\n- Clean refreshed user interface\r\n- Context-driven user experience focus\r\n- New module structure providing \"early-access\" to modules that are almost ready!\r\n\r\nAttend this presentation to see what is new, explore what has changed, and be reassured  by what remains familiar.\r\n\r\nTransition from GeoServer 2.x efficiently, with a focus on real-world adoption, and getting up to speed quickly.",
